    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for transitions that bring items in or take them out. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Assign one to a series&apos; <computeroutput>enterTransition</computeroutput> to animate added items, or to its <computeroutput>exitTransition</computeroutput> to animate removed items; an exit plays the movement backwards, while opacity animations play as written. Assigned to <computeroutput>updateTransition</computeroutput>, it redraws all new items as one sequence when a kept item changes, and the enter and exit transitions are skipped.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DrawTransition" kindref="compound">DrawTransition</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1GrowTransition" kindref="compound">GrowTransition</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
